deferred-sync Repository Version History
========================================

v26.09 (Release Date: TBD)
--------------------------
- Stop the local rsync backup when retention cleanup fails and correctly parse
  documented *_backup_YYYYMMDD retention names.
- Reject a missing EXPIREDAYS before retention cleanup without changing
  existing non-empty value semantics.
- Skip an unavailable STARTSCRIPT or ENDSCRIPT with a warning and continue the
  remaining run phases.
- Require each selective PLUGINS entry to resolve to exactly one readable
  plugin before sourcing it.
- Preserve exclusion preprocessing while rejecting an unreadable exclusion
  file before local rsync.
- Remove ping preflights from remote rsync paths so independent network policy
  does not block otherwise valid SSH transfers.
- Resolve the default installation correctly through the installer-created
  /etc/cron.exec/deferred-sync symlink.
- Avoid sudo for root installs, support Solaris cp options, and report required
  installer filesystem failures explicitly.
- Correct the cron MAILTO description and align affected documentation with
  the implemented runtime behavior.

